 "title": "30 V P-channel trench MOSFET in SOP-8",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Nov. 2024",
  "pages": 10
 },
 "summary": "A single P-channel enhancement MOSFET made on a trench process, in an eight-lead SOP-8 with three source leads, four drain leads and one gate. It blocks -30 V and carries -14 A continuously at 25 °C ambient (-56 A pulsed); on-resistance is 11.5 mΩ max with -10 V on the gate and 18.5 mΩ max at -4.5 V. The gate is rated ±25 V. Offered for load switching and PWM duty; lead-free and RoHS compliant.",
